    "title": "Change when a metric's data quality checks run",
    "category": "Data quality",
    "description": "Set how often every enabled check on a metric runs, or stop running them automatically. Name the subject with subject_type 'metric' and subject_uuid. Only a metric runs its checks on a schedule: a table's checks run after each sync of it, and a view's when the view refreshes, so naming either one is rejected. A metric gets a schedule when it takes its first check, so this fails with a 404 until then.",
